{"role":"tool","content":"    1\t[\r\n    2\t {\r\n    3\t  \"task_id\": \"0383a3ee-47a7-41a4-b493-519bdefe0488\",\r\n    4\t  \"question\": \"On the BBC Earth YouTube video of the Top 5 Silliest Animal Moments, what species of bird is featured?\",\r\n    5\t  \"gold\": \"Rockhopper penguin\",\r\n    6\t  \"got\": \"Penguin\",\r\n    7\t  \"secs\": 10.7,\r\n    8\t  \"raw_tail\": \"ANSWER: Penguin\\n\\n\",\r\n    9\t  \"correct\": false\r\n   10\t },\r\n   11\t {\r\n   12\t  \"task_id\": \"11af4e1a-5f45-467d-9aeb-46f4bb0bf034\",\r\n   13\t  \"question\": \"How many more blocks (also denoted as layers) in BERT base encoder than the encoder from the architecture proposed in Attention is All You Need?\",\r\n   14\t  \"gold\": \"6\",\r\n   15\t  \"got\": \"6\",\r\n   16\t  \"secs\": 11.1,\r\n   17\t  \"raw_tail\": \"To find how many more blocks (layers) the BERT-base encoder has compared to the encoder from the architecture proposed in *Attention Is All You Need*:\\n\\n* **BERT-base Encoder:** Has **12** encoder layers (transformer blocks).\\n* **Attention Is All You Need (Transformer) Encoder:** Has **6** encoder layers (stacked $N = 6$ times).\\n\\nCalculation: \\n$$12 - 6 = 6$$\\n\\nANSWER: 6\\n\\n\",\r\n   18\t  \"correct\": true\r\n   19\t },\r\n   20\t {\r\n   21\t  \"task_id\": \"23dd907f-1261-4488-b21c-e9185af91d5e\",\r\n   22\t  \"question\": \"In Audre Lorde\\u2019s poem \\u201cFather Son and Holy Ghost\\u201d, what is the number of the stanza in which some lines are indented?\",\r\n   23\t  \"gold\": \"2\",\r\n   24\t  \"got\": \"2\",\r\n   25\t  \"secs\": 14.0,\r\n   26\t  \"raw_tail\": \"ANSWER: 2\\n\\n\",\r\n   27\t  \"correct\": true\r\n   28\t },\r\n   29\t {\r\n   30\t  \"task_id\": \"27d5d136-8563-469e-92bf-fd103c28b57c\",\r\n   31\t  \"question\": \"\\u00ac(A \\u2227 B) \\u2194 (\\u00acA \\u2228 \\u00acB)\\n\\u00ac(A \\u2228 B) \\u2194 (\\u00acA \\u2227 \\u00acB)\\n(A \\u2192 B) \\u2194 (\\u00acB \\u2192 \\u00acA)\\n(A \\u2192 B) \\u2194 (\\u00acA \\u